{"unit_id":"Afeng-ovo__dsh-memory-lens#card-zh","repo":"Afeng-ovo/dsh-memory-lens","commit":"05b681a567ea83212ac89727d94931a12212cf9d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"记忆透镜（Memory Lens）是面向 DSH Web 客户端的长期记忆插件，通过 systemPrompt 注入记忆，并注册 remember、recall、forget 三个工具，让 agent 管理跨会话记忆。它把事实、偏好、约定和事件保存在本机 JSON 文件中，按固定、近期、话题和兜底层选择注入内容，并提供强度衰减与归档。设置面板支持浏览、搜索、编辑、导入、体检、对账和三维记忆图。适合希望 DSH 在重启后仍能记住重要信息并可检查、维护记忆库的用户。默认无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:557-633","lib/tools.js:141-182","lib/client.js:1472-1484","lib/store.js:28-60"]}
{"unit_id":"Afeng-ovo__dsh-memory-lens#card-en","repo":"Afeng-ovo/dsh-memory-lens","commit":"05b681a567ea83212ac89727d94931a12212cf9d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Memory Lens adds persistent memory to DSH. Its tools save, search, and manage facts, preferences, promises, and events in a local JSON file. Budgeted memories enter the system prompt, and a web panel supports browsing, editing, audits, comparison, and visualization. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:557-633","lib/tools.js:141-182","lib/client.js:1472-1484","lib/store.js:28-60"]}
